(Lth, L, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِيرٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزٌّ</span>
